  unitName: Knight Atro
  unitId: 50012
  unitNumber: 18
  description: A swordsman from the ruined La Veda Republic, later he became one
    of the Six Heroes. As advised by the Friar that raised him, Atro trained with
    a fencing master, quickly becoming a gifted swordsman. His technique was keen,
    and he had integrity thanks to his monastery childhood. He earned the title of
    "Sword Saint." Unaware of this, he continued to train daily.
  summonDesc: If you can show me the future,<br>with my Vedan fencing skills,<br>I
    will become your sword.
  fusionDesc: I am full of vigor.<br>How do you propose I make<br>use of this energy?
  evoDesc: I will dedicate my <br>Vedan fencing skills to<br>serving you.
  element: 5
  rarity: 2
